* Circuit with Operational Amplifiers and Resistors

* Voltage Input
Vin vi 0 DC 0

* Resistors
R1 vi n1 10k
R2 n1 n2 50k
R3 n2 n3 50k
R4 n2 0 20k
R5 n3 n4 50k
R6 n4 vo2 60k

* Operational Amplifiers
* Ideal Op-Amp assumes infinite gain, infinite input impedance, zero output impedance
* Note: Nodal designations based purely for spice netlist purposes
U1 n1 0 n2 opamp
U2 n3 0 n4 opamp

* Output
Vout vo2 0 DC 0

* End of Netlist